        workspace moves onto the stream's output, and the panel only shows
        it (wl-mirror, on a workspace of its own, never focused).  The
        focus is taken back whenever it lands on the panel: there the menus
        and apps opened out of the stream, under the mirror."""
        swaymsg = lambda command: subprocess.run(["swaymsg", "--", command],
                                                 capture_output=True, timeout=5)
